# Recorded input for the text area page (widgets/textarea.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 140 in the
# default theme: the Notes area ("one\ntwo", three lines shown) at x 12..308, y 38..98; text
# starts at (20, 42), 8.4 px per byte, 17.5 px per line. One line per frame below (format:
# input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40, Up 82, Down 81, Backspace 42.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 140
dt 0.016
pointer 300 135
# 1: press after "two": focused, caret at its end
frame
pointer 200 68
buttons left
# 2: release
frame
buttons
# 3: Enter and a third line
frame
press 40
text three
# 4: Up twice and Down again: back at the end of "two" (column 5 is past its end)
frame
press 82
press 82
press 81
# 5: Down to the last line, Enter, a fourth line: the view scrolls by one line
frame
press 81
press 40
text four
# 6: the wheel scrolls back to the top; the caret stays
frame
wheel 0 2
# 7: Shift+Up three times selects up to column 3 of "one"
frame
press 82 shift
press 82 shift
press 82 shift
# 8: Backspace deletes the selection: "one" is left
frame
press 42
